      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR ZIPPER (8) produced an impressive win last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by 4.5 lengths (22.01) at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. SILENT MINUTE (3) goes very well this course and distance starting eight times for three wins and two minors. Placed last time (22.86) at Wagga in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 4.5 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. HELLO CHEVY (2) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 9 lengths away in fifth (18.24). Was in the money the start prior. Key runner on best form. TOMMY'S DAWN (1) will need to repeat last run to feature.",
